msgid "Completed successfully — memory pressure test passed."
msgstr "成功完成 — 記憶體壓力測試通過。"

msgid ""
"Compress swap pages in a RAM pool — faster than disk swap. Use Zram or "
"Zswap, not both."
msgstr ""
"在記憶體池中壓縮交換頁面——比磁碟交換更快。請使用 Zram 或 Zswap，勿同時啟用。"

msgid "Compressed RAM block device — fast in-memory swap"
msgstr "壓縮式 RAM 區塊裝置 — 快速記憶體交換"

msgid "Compression algorithm"
msgstr "壓縮演算法"

msgid "Create"
msgstr "建立"

msgid "Create Zram Device"
msgstr "建立 Zram 裝置"

msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "控制面板"

msgid "Destroy Zram Device"
msgstr "銷毀 Zram 裝置"

msgid "Device Created"
msgstr "已建立裝置"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已停用"

msgid "Disabling Zswap..."
msgstr "正在停用 Swap…"

msgid "Disabling swap will break hibernation. Continue?"
msgstr "停用 Swap 將導致休眠功能失效。是否繼續？"

msgid "Disabling swap…"
msgstr "正在停用 Swap…"

msgid "Disk Swap"
msgstr "磁碟虛擬記憶體"

msgid "Disk Swap Configuration"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體磁盤設定"

msgid ""
"Disk swap is active with memory compression — your system is well-protected "
"against memory pressure."
msgstr "已啟用搭配記憶體壓縮的磁碟交換——您的系統能有效抵禦記憶體壓力。"

msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "持續時間："

msgid ""
"Enable Zram for snappy compressed swap in RAM — it's 10× faster than disk "
"swap and dramatically reduces I/O under memory pressure."
msgstr ""
"啟用 Zram 以獲得記憶體中敏捷的壓縮交換——它比磁碟交換快 10 倍，並大幅減少記憶"
"體壓力下的 I/O 負載。"

msgid "Enabling Zswap..."
msgstr "正在啟用 Swap…"

msgid "Enabling swap…"
msgstr "正在啟用 Swap…"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "錯誤"

msgid "Free"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Growth speed"
msgstr "增長速度"

msgid "Hibernation"
msgstr "休眠"

msgid "Hibernation Warning"
msgstr "休眠警告"

msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "非活動中"

msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "載入中..."

msgid "Maximum hold time"
msgstr "最大持有時間"

msgid "Maximum pool percent"
msgstr "最大空間百分比"

msgid "Memory Overview"
msgstr "記憶體總覽"

msgid "No Zram Devices"
msgstr "Zram 裝置"

msgid "No device"
msgstr "沒有裝置"

msgid "No disk swap detected"
msgstr "未偵測到虛擬記憶體交換"

msgid "No memory acceleration enabled"
msgstr "未啟用記憶體加速"

msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "On"
msgstr "開"

msgid ""
"Only store pages that compress to ≤ this % of original. Higher = more pages "
"cached. Recommended: 90%"
msgstr ""
"僅儲存壓縮後 ≤ 原始大小此百分比的頁面。數值越高 = 快取越多頁面。建議：90%"

msgid "Optimal memory configuration"
msgstr "最佳記憶體設定"

msgid "Peak allocated:"
msgstr "峰值分配量："

