msgstr "重新執行"

msgid "Run Stress Test"
msgstr "執行壓力測試"

msgid "Shrinker"
msgstr "記憶體回收器"

msgid "Size (MiB)"
msgstr "大小（MiB）"

msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

msgid "Stress Test"
msgstr "壓力測試"

msgid "Swap"
msgstr "交換空間"

msgid "Swap Control"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體控制"

msgid "Swap file size"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體檔案大小"

msgid "Swap usage"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體用量"

msgid "Swappiness"
msgstr "虛擬記憶體親和度"

msgid "Swappiness not optimized for Zram"
msgstr "未針對 Zram 最佳化 swappiness"

msgid "Target Pressure"
msgstr "目標壓力"

msgid "Test Complete"
msgstr "測試完成"

msgid "Total RAM"
msgstr "總記憶體"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

msgid "Used"
msgstr "已使用"

msgid ""
"When RAM is full the kernel may kill applications. Enable disk swap for a "
"reliable safety net."
msgstr "當記憶體滿載時，核心可能會終止應用程式。請啟用磁碟交換作為可靠的保障。"

msgid "Zram"
msgstr "壓縮記憶體段"

msgid "Zram Devices"
msgstr "Zram 裝置"

msgid "Zram and Zswap are both active"
msgstr "Zram 和 Zswap 均已啟用"

msgid ""
"Zram and Zswap are mutually exclusive — each creates its own compressed RAM "
"pool. Running both wastes CPU and can cause severe memory thrashing. Disable "
"one of them."
msgstr ""
"Zram 與 Zswap 互斥——各自建立獨立的壓縮記憶體池。同時執行會浪費 CPU 並可能導致"
"嚴重的記憶體抖動。請停用其中之一。"

msgid "Zswap"
msgstr "壓縮交換緩存"

msgid "default"
msgstr "預設"

msgid ""
"lz4 = fast (recommended), zstd = best ratio, lzo = legacy. Changing requires "
"zswap restart."
msgstr ""
"lz4 = 快速（推薦），zstd = 最佳壓縮率，lzo = 舊版。變更需要重新啟動 zswap。"

msgid "range"
msgstr "範圍"

msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

msgid "with Zram"
msgstr "已啟用 Zram"

msgid "with Zram active — prefer fast compressed RAM over disk cache"
msgstr "已啟用 Zram — 優先使用快速壓縮 RAM 而非磁碟快取"

